  LockedDialogue:
    Messages:
    - "Sorry, ter\xE1z nem\xF4\u017Eem lebo kresl\xEDm"
    - "Sk\xFAs pr\xEDs\u0165 o chv\xED\u013Eu"
  StartDialogue:
    Messages:
    - "T\xE1to ma\u013Eba by mohla by\u0165 lep\u0161ia keby som mala svoj \u0161tetec"
    - "Ty hlad\xE1\u0161 svoj Victus?"
    - "Zbehol by si mi pre \u0161tetec do labu?"
    - "Sk\xFAsim zatia\u013E porozm\xFD\u0161la\u0165 kde by mohol by\u0165 tvoj Victus"
  ItemDialogue:
    Messages:
    - "Thanks za ten \u0161tetec"
    - Tvoj Victus...
    - "No neviem, Vojtech nejak\xE9 schov\xE1val"
    - Atleast I think it was Vojtech
    - "Sk\xFAs a pozrie\u0165 do telocvi\u010Dne, tam by mal by\u0165"
  WrongItemDialogue:
    Messages:
    - "\u0160tetec by mal by\u0165 v labe"
    - "Sk\xFAs sa tam \xEDs\u0165 pozrie\u0165"
  AfterDialogue:
    Messages:
    - '*zvuky kreslenia*'
  StartQuest: "Cho\u010F za Zuzkou a sp\xFDtaj sa jej na Victus"
  ItemQuest: "Dones Zuzke \u0161tetec z labu"
